[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5160.07, "timestamp": "01:26:00", "text": "摧毀了我們的一切。是啊，就是這樣。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5162.629, "timestamp": "01:26:02", "text": "知道那件事是什麼嗎？我甚至不知道自己身在何處。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5171.59, "timestamp": "01:26:11", "text": "我就像我當時那樣，蹲著。這是個箱子，對吧？打開它，哦。  等等，其實我以為我已經擺脫它了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5175.83, "timestamp": "01:26:15", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5182.189, "timestamp": "01:26:22", "text": "只需雷射即可。媽的。  哦，不。  想得美，結果讓"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5183.739, "timestamp": "01:26:23", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joq why are your eyes the only thing glowing!?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5189.35, "timestamp": "01:26:29", "text": "我送了命。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5194.667, "timestamp": "01:26:34", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "T_T"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5201.91, "timestamp": "01:26:41", "text": "我們是怎麼接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5203.59, "timestamp": "01:26:43", "text": "雷射治療的？兄弟，在我前面等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5206.95, "timestamp": "01:26:46", "text": "。他開槍打了我。箱子裡是奈須木。  是的，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5215.91, "timestamp": "01:26:55", "text": "死了。他應該躲起來。他應該躲起來。你應該躲起來等死。你應該躲起來。笨蛋。"}]